{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Despises</b> — one who despises his fellow who is worthy of honor on account of his wisdom is lacking sense." "<b>And a man of understanding</b> — will bear the disgrace and keep silent so as not to despise his fellow, or he will keep silent and not answer him."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:22:07.489635291Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}